  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">底片攝影模組</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\" alt=\"相機\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\" alt=\"底片\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\" alt=\"沖洗\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\" alt=\"沖印\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\" alt=\"照片\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br></div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\" alt=\"附加功能\" width=\"260\"></p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\" alt=\"色彩變異\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\" alt=\"跨維投影機\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-polaroid\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\" alt=\"拍立得\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-catalog\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\" alt=\"目錄\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\" alt=\"底片負片\" width=\"1000\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" width=\"1000\" height=\"380\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fexposure%252flatest%252fdocs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"Wiki\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>已知不相容性：</strong></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Optifine</strong> - 已知會與其他模組產生問題。建議改用 Sodium/Embeddium。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Visual Overhaul</strong> - 開啟相機控制時會崩潰 - <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 問題回報</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Exordium</strong> - 透過觀景窗查看時會導致問題和畫面閃爍。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>FastAnim</strong> (Fabric) - 使用相機時會破壞玩家模型動畫。 <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 問題回報</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？&nbsp;您的支持能讓我有繼續開發它及其他模組的動力！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"558.73\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"191.75\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" alt=\"黃金相機\" width=\"1000\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"信封\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"粉筆\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"煙灰煙囪\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"商品\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"單銀行\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"小偷\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"鹽\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"學者\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"騎師\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
